    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Swiss independent digital type foundry based in Zurich, founded 1993 by Cornel Windlin and Stephan Muller, one of the first foundries to sell online (lineto.com launched 1998). Publishes their own type (Windlin, Muller) alongside invited designers with shared sensibilities (NORM's Dimitri Bruni and Manuel Krebs, Jurg and Urs Lehni, Laurenz Brunner). Notable typefaces include Akkurat and LL Circular (both Laurenz Brunner). LinkedIn lists ~12 employees, matches existing Size (11-40). No first-hand contact, org profile only.",
